se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/commit/0cbc24d7e031ef68b8150401f5697db41fde0572","node_id":"C_kwDON426CNoAKDBjYmMyNGQ3ZTAzMWVmNjhiODE1MDQwMWY1Njk3ZGI0MWZkZTA1NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/commit/e60cdf2007df00cee489a38417118e5def0b0840","sha":"e60cdf2007df00cee489a38417118e5def0b0840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/commits/e60cdf2007df00cee489a38417118e5def0b0840"}],"sha":"0cbc24d7e031ef68b8150401f5697db41fde0572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/commits/0cbc24d7e031ef68b8150401f5697db41fde0572"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8074436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/maxokorokov","id":8074436,"login":"maxokorokov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNzQ0MzY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxokorokov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/commits/e60cdf2007df00cee489a38417118e5def0b0840/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-02T20:55:09Z","email":"max@okorokov.com","name":"Max Okorokov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-02T20:55:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: introduce `messages`, `serviceMessages` and `error` streams (#19)\n\nIntroduce new APIs for message consumption. It will make it easier to dissociate peer creation with and places where messages might be consumed. It also uses Obsevable- and rxjs-compatible implementation for streams of messages.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE:\n\nNo longer possible to get messages via `onMessage`, `onServiceMessage`\nand `onError`at construction time, one should use`.messages`, `.serviceMessages`\nand `.errors` subscribable streams:\n\n```ts\n// BEFORE\nconst peer = new MessagePeer({\n  id: ''one'',\n  onMessage: (m) => {},\n  onServiceMessage: (m) => {},\n  onError: (e) => {}\n});\n\n// AFTER\nconst peer = new MessagePeer({ id: ''one'' });\n\npeer.messages.subscribe(m => {});\npeer.serviceMessages.subscribe(m => {});\npeer.errors.subscribe(e => {})\n```","tree":{"sha":"67abd9999668d46fbb2760ec16d975ca4de03629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/git/trees/67abd9999668d46fbb2760ec16d975ca4de03629"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmadeusITGroup/microfrontends/git/commits/e60cdf2007df00cee489a38417118e5def0b0840","verification":{"payload":"tree 67abd9999668d46fbb2760ec16d975ca4de03629\nparent ffba8e1f160c693cbeb3e53db7bf28b6503a4335\nauthor Max Okorokov <max@okorokov.com> 1743627309 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1743627309 +0200\n\nfeat: introduce `messages`, `serviceMessages` and `error` streams (#19)\n\nIntroduce new APIs for message consumption. It will make it easier to dissociate peer creation with and places where messages might be consumed. It also uses Obsevable- and rxjs-compatible implementation for streams of messages.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE:\n\nNo longer possible to get messages via `onMessage`, `onServiceMessage`\nand `onError`at construction time, one should use`.messages`, `.serviceMessages`\nand `.errors` subscribable streams:\n\n```ts\n// BEFORE\nconst peer = new MessagePeer({\n  id: ''one'',\n  onMessage: (m) => {},\n  onServiceMessage: (m) => {},\n  onError: (e) => {}\n});\n\n// AFTER\nconst peer = new MessagePeer({ id: ''one'' });\n\npeer.messages.subscribe(m => {});\npeer.serviceMessages.subscribe(m => {});\npeer.errors.subscribe(e => {})\n```","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn7aQtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1eMQAII2/SznvORN/FIWin8G9xPA\nsxFvpsm4xBuukE+RctzeVL1/ZI4lsTHHNTSn/HSgjd95DpyL20oQ1zTM9KPEIc8J\n0lws3vUFzRPs29VqBj9XJ5kquye49Naswt2zhXby9Hg7ktl7ytGXtAbnfsRs95rN\nTT8hdUpYfjecGjitXIUsQZKApHfcPpqjwX69TfXqOkjW7sG7WRYliYeAqug/LJi5\nSbcU+JS1oHxqbksu8pV2E0TUNC4deNrbTpYTNF3ujpLLZ3wuTZVMJUROiKPvUw7s\nQ7oC+RS7xBNtFvQul/r13W1r9WYiHXbCZOpp86y3/O122l1POTFwhT75VXyb18Bx\nhylFeuefE8QWnbrYjzS5UeoFP/mj1fgB4K6wxVwKUsVRWy8JRGkCiK28x4rxWt6R\nAgRhmRnJJ9POYWH931fzdYuXuW1IGn2lt1aIbSDbxMQkwvjRjoHjSKO0n0NaCCeB\nO28f1YkxiHHXpn37lVfgrSIpjt2zZvdwUQ2P3SQZtGntg/XdC0EcdypiVJMI9oaJ\nBaMc1u5P3v6C/HTlJLTpVgCJebrPHJU7pr4naYdUBYlnssnwXVVyYNjBY9Is+MfM\nTq+7EoLWTf8zpBXHYNdZT6qxYKNIv0BJd11RjB/56AVyG3VDlq9xZr7onJMuXJ5h\nqx6RSEkWCsr+30nPOrSC\n=Is5I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-02T20:55:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":