torovic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-10T20:46:38Z","email":"dusan.majstorovic@bosch.com","name":"Dusan Majstorovic"},"message":"Migrate entire application to TypeScript\n\nComplete TypeScript migration of all 4 microfrontend packages while\nmaintaining Webpack Module Federation architecture.\n\nChanges:\n- Converted 34 JavaScript files to TypeScript (.js → .ts/.tsx)\n- Added TypeScript configurations for all packages with moderate strictness\n- Updated webpack configs with ts-loader for React and Vue packages\n- Created type definitions for Module Federation remote modules\n- Implemented type-safe mount function interfaces across all MFEs\n- Migrated Dashboard.vue to use TypeScript with Composition API\n- Added comprehensive documentation (migration guide + quick reference)\n\nTechnical Details:\n- TypeScript with allowJs: true for gradual strictness increases\n- ts-loader with transpileOnly: true for fast build performance\n- Module Federation type declarations for type-safe remote imports\n- Vue 3 SFC TypeScript support with appendTsSuffixTo configuration\n- Material-UI v4 compatibility with --legacy-peer-deps\n\nAll packages build successfully and dev servers running:\n- container: http://localhost:8080 ✅\n- auth: http://localhost:8082 ✅\n- marketing: http://localhost:8081 ✅\n- dashboard: http://localhost:8083 ✅\n\nDocumentation:\n- docs/typescript-migration.md - Complete migration documentation\n- docs/typescript-quick-reference.md - Developer quick reference\n- docs/README.md - Documentation index\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8dcc3512864a9703a4e055230563c0d82231007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/majdule/mfe_dashboard-master-ds/git/trees/b8dcc3512864a9703a4e055230563c0d82231007"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/majdule/mfe_dashboard-master-ds/git/commits/8942d849114bd6c8a3922beb0b18228e66d295af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"veri