:"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KoWming/MoviePilot-Plugins/commits/ae921d7ef65fcc6dd29971387a8f573e6db64fcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:49:51Z","email":"1075151242@qq.com","name":"KoWming"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:49:51Z","email":"1075151242@qq.com","name":"KoWming"},"message":"feat 更新 Vue-光鸭云盘储存 v3.1.0\n\n补齐 V3 存储适配：新增 get_folder 能力，并把 storage_manage 与 get_folder 一并登记进插件模块声明（宿主只分派声明过的方法），存储设置页的光鸭云盘不再显示「未配置」，依赖目录复建的流程不再失败；list_files / any_files 未初始化时改返回 None，避免被宿主当成「目录确实为空」而误删；快照条目补齐 fileid，同大小同时间戳的替换文件可被识别；接口按 V3 响应合同改造：五个端点全部声明 response_model，配置读取返回业务模型，其余改用统一三段式 envelope 并把业务字段移入 data，扫码等待不再按业务失败处理（此前每轮轮询都会误报错误）；另补齐 get_render_mode 静态方法签名、复用宿主自身的 StorageQueryError、宿主进度回调缺失时降级而不影响插件加载。","tree":{"sha":"e1cb1c00c47e7dea2fa53138c9247e46aa1ee677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KoWming/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/trees/e1cb1c00c47e7dea2fa53138c9247e46aa1ee677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KoWming/MoviePilot-Plugins/git/commits/ae921d7ef65fcc6dd29971387a8f573e6db64fcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96684377?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoWming/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com