{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10266249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/snoodleboot","id":10266249,"login":"snoodleboot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjY2MjQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/927f48b699d0bcbf45ff24cb88af69e5fdb7ad08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:54:37Z","email":"John.aven.phd@gmail.com","name":"John Aven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:54:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: run the Playwright e2e suite, including the only a11y coverage (#63) (#64)\n\nAdds a `frontend-e2e` CI job so the Playwright suite — the project''s only\na11y coverage — is gated on every PR instead of run by hand.\n\nAlso binds the e2e preview server to 127.0.0.1 so the runner can reach it,\nand caps the job at 10 minutes.\n\nVerified on this run against current main: `Running 6 tests` -> `6 passed`,\ncovering the three P9 Constellation specs (keyboard impact selection, the\nreduced-motion collapse via page.emulateMedia, and the derived-bump readout)\nalongside the pre-existing smoke and axe passes.","tree":{"sha":"40e93956b75e279f66ba39b2235585dbca92f293","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/trees/40e93956b75e279f66ba39b2235585dbca92f293"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/commits/927f48b699d0bcbf45ff24cb88af69e5fdb7ad08","verification":{"payload":"tree 40e93956b75e279f66ba39b2235585dbca92f293\nparent b73d04f7f882c7265f09e9020074ce8ddcf5ed36\nauthor John Aven <John.aven.phd@gmail.com> 1787799277 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787799277 -0500\n\nci: run the Playwright e2e suite, including the only a11y coverage (#63) (#64)\n\nAdds a `frontend-e2e` CI job so the Playwright suite — the project''s only\na11y coverage — is gated on every PR instead of run by hand.\n\nAlso binds the e2e preview server to 127.0.0.1 so the runner can reach it,\nand caps the job at 10 minutes.\n\nVerified on this run against current main: `Running 6 tests` -> `6 passed`,\ncovering the three P9 Constellation specs (keyboard impact selection, the\nreduced-motion collapse via page.emulateMedia, and the derived-bump readout)\nalongside the pre-existing smoke and axe passes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj6btCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWEEQADrOilLcTWkAvzospuhdPqN0\nZ4yI5JySfK8hdvfXHR9VGuferfDBT1lfZR2MOMzy+XUe0jy7IJlVP/7IH7qEX51j\niTPK3BQFM+y5Z6wgqS3OpgGdRgE5ueRW8PsxpUb4WrylJd/LVBSlv4VYb7klQasv\n2NKFllat5K2DMVBzPoQgJRKGe25UTkH8FjL0uXjWkuboqQsqkywoyKCccMElBRQm\npsplY6HaXZtG6/IyYk2MaO4+UgFBbPu/HqQgOqJ1pcI50QIcuR4LjzhT63jBMUiB\nBWGYUJAxi7VI/r/myWPg06b+nRcDcIe+W5RO8MWXb4CT9Hj8TR3m9ENUEZOvkuMJ\nzePOUSxDNinsnl+n27rydWN71lCAfZsDJUm2N4yDeqUPF1xOmunAzYaUn3PQP63b\nHBRYbX7V2F8g0PXgqSWbRUbXRGUZJbPVB2vTmAMYq8ZrW1c78aAqW4S3Xva5Jxrb\nijeYYGt1PquOaKvgoKqjrQQkOw2ItvSatUXdAmksGQ1bKHcjkOjLQN8ozN61Blmc\nwJijDRx3b4ZRj4vHrdkZGP2OySFmTMm+Omk4UXbVieXzxQ9gG7WVWs4DQrCu8jb5\nQzx+xuEDNLT8fazwi/x5OR6ExSU9zuybFnftR5h4TstBUh+z/K8Y7C4fZea0mlOd\nU0cfD7yM4TZgTJb1vtik\n=E6rh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-27T02:54:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_