,"login":"snoodleboot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjY2MjQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/b73d04f7f882c7265f09e9020074ce8ddcf5ed36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:05:23Z","email":"John.aven.phd@gmail.com","name":"John Aven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T07:05:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"bugfix(deps): clear the three frontend Dependabot alerts (#71)\n\nAll three are dev-scope transitive dependencies of vite and eslint, and all\nthree fixes sit inside the existing semver ranges — so this is a lockfile\nrefresh at full depth, not a range change. `package.json` is untouched and no\n`pnpm.overrides` pin is introduced.\n\n- js-yaml 4.3.0 -> 4.3.1 (via @eslint/eslintrc) — GHSA high: quadratic CPU\n  consumption resolving !!omap.\n- postcss 8.5.17 -> 8.5.26 (via vite) — clears both the high\n  (sourceMappingURL path traversal disclosing arbitrary .map files) and the\n  moderate incomplete-fix follow-up, which needed >= 8.5.23.\n- nanoid 3.3.16 -> 3.3.18 rides along as postcss''s own dependency.\n\nVerified: tsc, eslint, prettier, vite build, 172 unit tests (coverage\n98.4/90.3/95.2/98.4) and all 6 Playwright specs pass on the refreshed tree.","tree":{"sha":"cdfed32782f5f4d1a3977e61c65a9aa33e8952b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/trees/cdfed32782f5f4d1a3977e61c65a9aa33e8952b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/commits/b73d04f7f882c7265f09e9020074ce8ddcf5ed36","verification":{"payload":"tree cdfed32782f5f4d1a3977e61c65a9aa33e8952b9\nparent b0bea4edf2637259d6e60aafdcef85ea3d25bece\nauthor John Aven <John.aven.phd@gmail.com> 1787468723 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787468723 -0500\n\nbugfix(deps): clear the three frontend Dependabot alerts (#71)\n\nAll three are dev-scope transitive dependencies of vite and eslint, and all\nthree fixes sit inside the existing semver ranges — so this is a lockfile\nrefresh at full depth, not a range change. `package.json` is untouched and no\n`pnpm.overrides` pin is introduced.\n\n- js-yaml 4.3.0 -> 4.3.1 (via @eslint/eslintrc) — GHSA high: quadratic CPU\n  consumption resolving !!omap.\n- postcss 8.5.17 -> 8.5.26 (via vite) — clears both the high\n  (sourceMappingURL path traversal disclosing arbitrary .map files) and the\n  moderate incomplete-fix follow-up, which needed >= 8.5.23.\n- nanoid 3.3.16 -> 3.3.18 rides along as postcss''s own dependency.\n\nVerified: tsc, eslint, prettier, vite build, 172 unit tests (coverage\n98.4/90.3/95.2/98.4) and all 6 Playwright specs pass on the refreshed tree.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqipuzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2CkQAHhoN/daDO2knRP/6VUBP/6x\n4aFQuiKBE0j7htsghsYRdO4mJoThsdTDVG4QnDnSqrJv9zRnews3aHbivYq6QTnU\nfBuD8zwxDReizPjKeUwahB9vmNd2ggpyBBVcvWI//1fnxD0/xnqsGvX2vl8jcC48\nCoxBxC9HG3MT6byyeHcci/5W0VMRfefZxm9sRpzCQ2+d0ZAvPkqk6lGSfgqM/5s5\nqjpImmg+dq04jsUiafsxnFgNV5+IEwGI6hxMwQVt6ro3eRVP6hSi95oVt+VLYo3r\noQZKlYVVzE0ErQOcDUZWdrQBcDafTyKGDz8jNcYHwmVBQwz54ZnvJF49XGTJZOr+\ncW6WWRziyw+yWiuvW6XILkagpv8ZVyyk/Hq2AqaoLDUz+Qh24i0OdelDyNeWFl4Z\nGoOwFIw1qoZXaaPOdRQrZ2aXrnCdehXMi1L4rO1eFxzBKvG/SzD14YOXvqWSINg9\nozMjLjbgJnyp0d6CrShImrAIaSgylabJS3U2/BW8j0i3FKijqbySL72PBjGOcAJ9\nZZtjTeNatcAaKl0l+q3jfyAt06XHZWVFiVADlyATOhdPegsFxP4GAx5cAfnnQMTv\nJVS28wORfgJBMvWcevPyF+3uQF4xt2rAtiFZYzNStrHiexw0KtW3z2mF/IYXHiKJ\nqGe/YbXJ/voGH1p8FxaK\n=CvqZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified"