events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/2bb462d96211025d050d1dd6f61ca3b9949947cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:33:34Z","email":"John.aven.phd@gmail.com","name":"John Aven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T06:33:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ui): dependency edge layer for the Constellation (LAV-61) (#67)\n\nFoundation (§0) + F1 of the P9 frontend plan.\n\nFoundation, shared by F1/F2/F3:\n- types: ChangeLevel/BumpLevel unions, Dependency, GraphResponse,\n  ImpactedComponent, Impact; Release gains bump_level/bump_rationale and\n  ReleaseComponent gains change_level (contract §10).\n- read-only api modules getGraph/getImpact on the shared http client.\n- queryKeys.graph / queryKeys.impact under the [''products'', id, …] prefix.\n- --patch token (#9fb0cc) beside the existing --danger/--warn.\n- MSW: seeded dependencies, GET /graph and GET /impact handlers, and an\n  enriched cut that returns change_level plus a realistic JSON bump_rationale.\n\nF1 — the edge layer:\n- useGraph(productId) mirrors useTimeline.\n- DependencyEdges paints one muted arc per dependency in a reserved left\n  gutter, arrowhead at the dependency, under the streams and non-interactive\n  so it never steals the meridian''s pointer capture.\n- Lane labels are bounded with SVG textLength so the gutter is genuinely\n  label-free — a guarantee the unit tests assert rather than assume.","tree":{"sha":"32903854e4930636150bc17f1a7bf9facc44eb4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/trees/32903854e4930636150bc17f1a7bf9facc44eb4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/commits/2bb462d96211025d050d1dd6f61ca3b9949947cc","verification":{"payload":"tree 32903854e4930636150bc17f1a7bf9facc44eb4a\nparent 7e4ce03947ec30e90a8e84f3f4658864aad0d2ee\nauthor John Aven <John.aven.phd@gmail.com> 1787466814 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787466814 -0500\n\nfeat(ui): dependency edge layer for the Constellation (LAV-61) (#67)\n\nFoundation (§0) + F1 of the P9 frontend plan.\n\nFoundation, shared by F1/F2/F3:\n- types: ChangeLevel/BumpLevel unions, Dependency, GraphResponse,\n  ImpactedComponent, Impact; Release gains bump_level/bump_rationale and\n  ReleaseComponent gains change_level (contract §10).\n- read-only api modules getGraph/getImpact on the shared http client.\n- queryKeys.graph / queryKeys.impact under the [''products'', id, …] prefix.\n- --patch token (#9fb0cc) beside the existing --danger/--warn.\n- MSW: seeded dependencies, GET /graph and GET /impact handlers, and an\n  enriched cut that returns change_level plus a realistic JSON bump_rationale.\n\nF1 — the edge layer:\n- useGraph(productId) mirrors useTimeline.\n- DependencyEdges paints one muted arc per dependency in a reserved left\n  gutter, arrowhead at the dependency, under the streams and non-interactive\n  so it never steals the meridian''s pointer capture.\n- Lane labels are bounded with SVG textLength so the gutter is genuinely\n  label-free — a guarantee the unit tests assert rather than assume.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqipQ+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkc4QAHYjKMieXCOuTXBMGT3r1kLU\n25/Abvj2TlqaXA341yk7/8+ZF34biLCBZoIQ+eJHhxTbrW4+BJFMZrzOH04X6+o6\nExo3YWjlkuRDKZ4E8eSPV1VjvwutN0aL2rRvVhYpJ0yavI1sMeOU0ST3vuhD16Bo\n3IS3jh9z9lKslnzWu0mnfscaXX/5TuqoWtBbW32uHWDJH+1JqfkWeax3X2LOqQHz\nd+h40bYpTHn904JcTlkvuAsjI6CC9AjoU/PECeJuUI5oxb4/IRS13nU+KhEX5EGP\nFCKCg0idtNwxx6CSkhMbUosXLd7XCK2dxYH3lAnaqJBI4atoYkK08bJ3iXX3