pi.github.com/users/snoodleboot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/3bed89228de3269dd6379b091b7eb3830826ce12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:57:26Z","email":"John.aven.phd@gmail.com","name":"John Aven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:57:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(backends): parity suites must fail (not skip) in CI (#50)\n\nThe postgres/mysql parity fixtures pytest.skip when Docker/the container is\nunavailable — correct for local dev, but in CI a silent skip gives a false\ngreen on the multi-backend exit criterion. Add _containers_unavailable():\nskip locally, but pytest.fail when CI is set (GitHub Actions always sets it),\nso DuckDB/Postgres/MySQL parity can never be silently skipped in CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa65a5c279908ff62f3cba726eb1bad2866a2a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/trees/aa65a5c279908ff62f3cba726eb1bad2866a2a84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/commits/3bed89228de3269dd6379b091b7eb3830826ce12","verification":{"payload":"tree aa65a5c279908ff62f3cba726eb1bad2866a2a84\nparent e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e\nauthor John Aven <John.aven.phd@gmail.com> 1786841846 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786841846 +0000\n\ntest(backends): parity suites must fail (not skip) in CI (#50)\n\nThe postgres/mysql parity fixtures pytest.skip when Docker/the container is\nunavailable — correct for local dev, but in CI a silent skip gives a false\ngreen on the multi-backend exit criterion. Add _containers_unavailable():\nskip locally, but pytest.fail when CI is set (GitHub Actions always sets it),\nso DuckDB/Postgres/MySQL parity can never be silently skipped in CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgQr2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA72UQAEU11Fmn8P/BASWKOownMT91\n57FZO7gpudwa+vWCwB880VkJa2x2ccWwVG817U6mkgROo148cBDb6M5kHU8+95mm\nBQZJdAog/pX6sw0X6vZLCFqzhbMyNM8WjXlJcaWBbSzsyNrabaEvmkc4dYDYiuZK\n9GWhdQY0YwVMWBu7ocbwoZoyFjIdxpeohn3+gdI6P+Ax6aQqml+nE9Pq+WtavTx7\nNnI8G8YW9Kqmxw7qo3qbJDjZ401MBx4IOg2e9i93lepBQpEIZEDTiIrMSgz/fmLs\nNhvlXIECc6nirxnyFVMtXLb4WnNl3Oq6JDNNJYdc9u6/9survv30Cd5V9MYYQbnD\nPEpyt2Eqp3gCkwI6fZ0do5fCbx4+BOaetc+U38/fjB0cZ9ivRsrGNOZTdWAY/yAd\nXqo/AGJPSOQexBHRW3yPTSQyowQMBuEAmRnMlCLeM44jdKtYaPvZck0I5rb9+df+\nikuO23qKYyfc3/6uiaReHbjS4+Mnr484cDm29aqyeuFiBUQSI3kHV5O+GRJJoQXi\n3Gsm7m4mWT0y0EnSRCP9HAVPIyALqGDGYTvskys/abhNJYV3DLnnEOA70GvWzP8r\nhLoC3fIs5TeAxrwcmPfgoR3VWoF91lO9QzcZOdZ/EUNrmHGHwIgg02mPnO38NNu/\njo19396YtqC6JZSV9bXd\n=SQSM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-16T00:57:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commit/3bed89228de3269dd6379b091b7eb3830826ce12","node_id":"C_kwDON50rGNoAKDNiZWQ4OTIyOGRlMzI2OWRkNjM3OWIwOTFiN2ViMzgzMDgyNmNlMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commit/e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e","sha":"e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e"}],"sha":"3bed89228de3269dd6379b091b7eb3830826ce12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/3bed89228de3269dd6379b091b7eb3830826ce12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10266249?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/snoodleboot","id":10266249,"login":"snoodleboot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjY2MjQ5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snoodleboot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/commits/e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:06:57Z","email":"John.aven.phd@gmail.com","name":"John Aven"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T00:06:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(persistence): MySQL backend — same API suite passes on MySQL (#47) (#48)\n\nThird dialect behind the Backend interface, mirroring PostgresBackend:\n- MySqlBackend (PyMySQL, PYFORMAT %s, autocommit, split-statement init_schema)\n- app/database/mysql/ddl.sql (InnoDB/utf8mb4; VARCHAR(255) keyed cols; DATETIME\n  for naive-UTC; table-level FKs since MySQL ignores inline REFERENCES)\n- PyMySqlConnection adapter (PyMySQL executes via cursor, not connection.execute)\n- BackendKind.MYSQL + LAVS_MYSQL_* settings + factory registration (additive;\n  DuckDB stays default)\n\nNew runtime dep: pymysql>=1.1.1 (pure-python). Exit criterion met — the same\nparity suite runs green against a live mysql:8.4 testcontainer (8 tests, no\nskips). 504 → 518 tests. Value-safety preserved (params bound, never\ninterpolated). Gates A/B PASS; ruff/format/pyright clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1ceaff5aeec413a58f649174af0c99a4d0e8e8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/trees/e1ceaff5aeec413a58f649174af0c99a4d0e8e8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snoodleboot-io/lavs-core/git/commits/e4845c75e4fd44faca7dc1e19feca2b31eb0dd5e","verification":{"payload":"tree e1ceaff5aeec413a58f649174af0c99a4d0e8e8d\nparent 0fa16047edfec6144b1a8e7d5c0019d8f2e6e23b\nauthor John Aven <John.aven.phd@gmail.com> 1786838817 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786838817 +0000\n\nfeat(persistence): MySQL backend — same API suite passes on MySQL (#47) (#48)\n\nThird dialect behind the Backend interface, mirroring PostgresBackend:\n- MySqlBackend (PyMySQL, PYFORMAT %s, autocommit, split-statement init_schema)\n- app/database/mysql/ddl.sql (InnoDB/utf8mb4; VARCHAR(255) keyed cols; DATETIME\n  for naive-UTC; table-level FKs since MySQL ignores inline REFERENCES)\n- PyMySqlConnection adapter (PyMySQL executes via cursor, not connection.execute)\n- BackendKind.MYSQL + LAVS_MYSQL_* settings + factory registration (additive;\n  DuckDB stays default)\n\nNew runtime dep: pymysql>=1.1.1 (pure-python). Exit criterion met — the same\nparity suite runs green against a live mysql:8.4 testcontainer (8 tests, no\nskips). 504 → 518 tests. Value-safety preserved (params bound, never\ninterpolated). Gates A/B PASS; ruff/format/pyright clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgP8hCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd2gQAGMpgNwL40J3ImBq5L4faVED\n//61fzrvx7kBNR4h09eyhXj1WGf75YmL6xSlFGuXmY/7ck2VpGKIZzCNHUEkGVUL\nsAk+Zqf66VwaSO3WJVVNyOvBWDee0KBoTw8oY+9kV6fo++qdN4W4/3MZgB5J+O/6\nBVdXGzD9rjTgMREw/J83BSNAQr6Ng8Iczadmo0yw8npf9WRx2Jo639t0UGd2Jo4l\nUmi4/6hZTVdxYQaqPG6p+EbYLdJejDuTaRv3cRA/oU6nn8irqFE2OcCOHsrKa5G/\nysbonFnJeNmXdtHL4fwL7CFY0dZz/XmnchQUEOewbaYH19YI1q/RwaTKvyNVg7FU\n3RhjGCQO94uBF7DQrTRLWoldGu2MAVnT21VHn9BbD3D5vpPqk45kxjgdPepCgmU1\nFsvadCjaOpLU6OG4+3tCh7Yw7kBZJVaQXGaodzKoz7X5drusIlzQqPfW7fMYM9T2\nEa5mubPplUTQ1tQFb5plBAfI8h947LHD9mh6WoP1gC544FT7tyZUdm0O6fQeIsKv\n2XWWgv/WDWYOcbA518Yy9AeoKx0nk3ktrSprLYA0F221efGvTdjmEVg6j3kTHq32\nv9C/5qA493cFZPvBm0UgLzEASQ0i1fdBsoA2TDDEXoSNJO2A1crGEUX2celmjThQ\n3kibYeOvPNPg+El5NsHm\n=GBOk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-16T00:06:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web