ent predictions.\n- Create test_prediction_api.py for testing API endpoints related to predictions.\n- Update prediction_controller.py to enhance model listing functionality.\n- Modify database.py to improve migration handling and schema initialization.\n- Enhance prediction_job.py to streamline prediction processing and error handling.\n- Add SQL migration scripts for new item_id column and table creation.\n- Update prediction models and schemas to accommodate new data structures.","tree":{"sha":"5afd28dcb763891f591e51fa7a81dc4862a92296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caiotheodoro/synkro/git/trees/5afd28dcb763891f591e51fa7a81dc4862a92296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caiotheodoro/synkro/git/commits/fc4f68ad04df5706d427ac49002ce6721fe58553","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48462974?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/caiotheodoro","id":48462974,"login":"caiotheodoro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NDYyOTc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caiotheodoro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/caiotheodoro/synkro/commit/fc4f68ad04df5706d427ac49002ce6721fe58553","node_id":"C_kwDON6pH9toAKGZjNGY2OGF