om/users/dParadiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dParadiz","id":2454488,"login":"dParadiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQ0ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commits/589f041a37de992b94326c7161f4c0a7e92bb061/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:07:53Z","email":"dparadiz@gmail.com","name":"dParadiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:07:53Z","email":"dparadiz@gmail.com","name":"dParadiz"},"message":"fix(persistence): consolidate IndexedDB schema into single versioned provider\n\nMultiple repos independently opened MykoboardDB with their own\nonupgradeneeded handlers. Whichever opened first won and the other''s\nstore creation never fired, causing NotFoundError and VersionError\nwhen stores were accessed before they were created.\n\n- src/infrastructure/persistence/MykoboardDB.ts [NEW]\n  Single authoritative DB opener (v6). All object store definitions\n  live here. Module-level promise singleton prevents concurrent opens.\n  Exports resetSharedDB() for test isolation.\n\n- IndexedDbSessionRepo, IndexedDbKnownIdentityRepo\n  Drop their own indexedDB.open() calls; delegate to getSharedDB().\n\n- GameInfoView: replace direct lib/db import with injected SessionRepoKey\n- PastMatchesView: point GameSession type import at domain layer\n- useBoardState: remove lib/sessions dependency; call sessionRepo.getGame /\n  saveGame directly with inline participant merge keyed by publicKey\n\nAll 40 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"1bff2bcfc694acdf5400eb359726d25af890b397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/git/trees/1bff2bcfc694acdf5400eb359726d25af890b397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/git/commits/589f041a37de992b94326c7161f4c0a7e92bb061","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2454488?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dParadiz","id":2454488,"login":"dParadiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQ0ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commit/589f041a37de992b94326c7161f4c0a7e92bb061","node_id":"C_kwDON9aQ8toAKDU4OWYwNDFhMzdkZTk5MmI5NDMyNmM3MTYxZjRjMGE3ZTkyYmIwNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commit/e374877e2e952c7702f1e4f57c98097b27bff57d","sha":"e374877e2e952c7702f1e4f57c98097b27bff57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commits/e374877e2e952c7702f1e4f57c98097b27bff57d"}],"sha":"589f041a37de992b94326c7161f4c0a7e92bb061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commits/589f041a37de992b94326c7161f4c0a7e92bb061"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2454488?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dParadiz","id":2454488,"login":"dParadiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQ0ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/commits/e374877e2e952c7702f1e4f57c98097b27bff57d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T21:47:01Z","email":"dparadiz@gmail.com","name":"dParadiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T21:47:01Z","email":"dparadiz@gmail.com","name":"dParadiz"},"message":"feat(auth): guard board page against anonymous access\n\nAdds a router navigation guard that blocks users without an established\nidentity from reaching any route with `meta.requiresSession`. Anonymous\nusers (including deep-link offer URLs) are redirected to the index page\nwith the original destination preserved in `?redirect=`.\n\nAn in-page `IdentityRequiredModal` acts as a secondary safety net for\nthe async identity-load window (IndexedDB resolves after navigation).\nThe modal lets users create their identity inline and then navigates\nthem back to the original destination.\n\n- src/router/guards/identityGuard.ts — pure, injectable guard factory\n- src/router/index.ts — wires guard via compositionRoot identity ref\n- src/components/IdentityRequiredModal.vue — fallback UI for null identity\n- src/pages/BoardView.vue — shows modal; skips machine init without identity\n- src/composables/useBoardState.ts — removes `|| ''local''` publicKey fallback\n  and fixes duplicate object key on localPlayer (silent dead-code bug)\n- src/composables/useP2PNegotiation.ts — removes unused PlayerInfo import\n- tests/router/identityGuard.test.ts — TDD: written before implementation\n\nAll 40 tests pass.","tree":{"sha":"efd87d86900646ec68b4e298dc9af2f864031e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/git/trees/efd87d86900646ec68b4e298dc9af2f864031e30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mykoboard/mykoboard.github.io/git/commits/e374877e2e952c7702f1e4f57c98097b27bff57d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2454488?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dParadiz","id":2454488,"login":"dParadiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQ0ODg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dParadiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/m