@sap.com","name":"Aleksei Paramonov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:27Z","email":"aleksei.paramonov@sap.com","name":"Aleksei Paramonov"},"message":"feat(sentry): expose userError and technicalError in GraphQL error extensions\n\nWhen WithUserMessage is set, the GraphQL error response now includes both\nfields in extensions alongside the existing code:\n- userError: the safe user-facing message\n- technicalError: the raw underlying error string (for FE logging/debug)\n\nThe message field continues to carry the user-friendly string so existing\nclients that only read message are unaffected.\n\nSigned-off-by: Aleksei Paramonov <aleksei.paramonov@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"38bbd8366ab8cf9c93c378bcb407beba7d6408c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/platform-mesh/git/trees/38bbd8366ab8cf9c93c378bcb407beba7d6408c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/platform-mesh/git/commits/53aa3cbeb5f3f680b8cc5fc5bc2c20aafaddfabb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207030094?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aleksei-paramonov","id":207030094,"login":"aleksei-paramonov","node_id":"U_kgDODFcHTg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aleksei-paramonov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us