"login":"lpgarzonr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MTkyNTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/platform-mesh/commits/9404f210952746701dafdd17ec5319356a27ecb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:12:24Z","email":"leidy.garzon@sap.com","name":"Leidy Garzon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:32:39Z","email":"leidy.garzon@sap.com","name":"Leidy Garzon"},"message":"fix(lifecycle): skip sentry capture on status update when resource is not found\n\nWhen OrphanInstanceDeletionSubroutine deletes a resource and returns a\nnon-retryable error, the LifecycleManager still calls updateStatus() on\nthe now-deleted resource. The resulting NotFound error was incorrectly\ncaptured to Sentry as an unexpected failure.\n\nAdd a NotFound guard in updateStatus to log at Info level and skip Sentry,\nsince a deleted resource is an expected outcome of orphan cleanup.\n\nSigned-off-by: Leidy Garzon <leidy.garzon@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"db0c9fbb97014fc53f26ec26afaae139ddd13479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/platform-mesh/git/trees/db0c9fbb97014fc53f26ec26afaae139ddd13479"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/platform-mesh/git/commits/9404f210952746701dafdd17ec5319356a27ecb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6719251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lpgarzonr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a